    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13207" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομετρ-έω</span></b> , fut.
		
			Med.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.3073.77
				</span></i>
			 (Lebad.):—<i>measure off</i> or <i>out,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θριγκούς</span> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακτυλίους μεδίμνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					12.2
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεδίμνῳ ἀπομετρήσασθαι τὸ ἀργύριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					3.2.27
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be measured off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.27.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.1.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>measure out, distribute,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				10.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτόν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					2.5.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.
			<i><span class="en">
				5.6
			</span></i>.</div>
